    "scenesThatPass": [
      "TREE: Thanks for that, Danielle. Really, so thoughtful.\nDANIELLE: What are sisters for?",
      "DANIELLE: -- and we still need to pick this year’s charity. I can say right now, there is no way we’re doing the Special Needs art fair again. All tho…\nBECKY: What’s wrong?\nDANIELLE: I don’t know. What’s wrong Tree?\nTREE: Nothing. Except for the buffet you just dumped on our table.",
      "TREE: Lori...\nLORI: Hi.\nTREE: So, I thought you only work nights.\nLORI: I’m doing a double for Jen. She has the flu.",
      "DANIELLE: Oh-my-god. You sneaky beeyotch!\nDANIELLE: Who was it? Sisters don’t keep secrets.\nTREE: No, I’m totally having deja vu right now.\nDANIELLE: I have it all the time. It’s supposed to mean somebody’s like walking over your grave or something.",
      "DANIELLE: -- and we still need to pick this year’s charity. I can say right now, there is no way we’re doing the Special Needs art fair again. All tho…\nBECKY: What’s wrong?\nDANIELLE: I don’t know. What’s wrong Tree?\nTREE: I’m just a little tired, I guess."
    ]
